"<section open=""><article class="max-w-md max-h-[90vh] overflow-y-auto"><header><h2 class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-settings"><path d="M12.22 2h-.44a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v.18a2 2 0 0 1-1 1.73l-.43.25a2 2 0 0 1-2 0l-.15-.08a2 2 0 0 0-2.73.73l-.22.38a2 2 0 0 0 .73 2.73l.15.1a2 2 0 0 1 1 1.72v.51a2 2 0 0 1-1 1.74l-.15.09a2 2 0 0 0-.73 2.73l.22.38a2 2 0 0 0 2.73.73l.15-.08a2 2 0 0 1 2 0l.43.25a2 2 0 0 1 1 1.73V20a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h.44a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-.18a2 2 0 0 1 1-1.73l.43-.25a2 2 0 0 1 2 0l.15.08a2 2 0 0 0 2.73-.73l.22-.39a2 2 0 0 0-.73-2.73l-.15-.08a2 2 0 0 1-1-1.74v-.5a2 2 0 0 1 1-1.74l.15-.09a2 2 0 0 0 .73-2.73l-.22-.38a2 2 0 0 0-2.73-.73l-.15.08a2 2 0 0 1-2 0l-.43-.25a2 2 0 0 1-1-1.73V4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle></svg> 差出人情報の設定</h2><p>請求書に表示される差出人（From）のデフォルト情報を設定します。</p></header><div class="space-y-3 py-2"><div><label class="text-xs">会社ロゴ（インボイスに表示）</label><div class="mt-1 flex items-center gap-3"><div class="w-16 h-16 border-2 border-dashed border-border rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center bg-muted/30 overflow-hidden cursor-pointer hover:border-primary/50 transition-colors flex-shrink-0"><img src="data:image/png;base64,AA==" alt="Logo preview" class="w-full h-full object-contain"/></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-1"><button type="button" variant="outline" class="h-7 text-xs gap-1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-upload"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"></path><polyline points="17 8 12 3 7 8"></polyline><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="3" y2="15"></line></svg> 画像を選択</button><button type="button" variant="ghost" class="h-7 text-xs text-muted-foreground">削除</button><p class="text-[10px] text-muted-foreground">PNG/JPG, 2MB以下</p></div></div><input type="file" accept="image/png,image/jpeg,image/gif,image/webp" class="hidden"/></div><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3"><div><label class="text-xs">名前</label><input placeholder="例: 村上 肥" class="h-8 text-sm mt-1" value="Saved Sender"/></div><div><label class="text-xs">会社名</label><input placeholder="例: Murakami Trading" class="h-8 text-sm mt-1" value=""/></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3"><div><label class="text-xs">メール</label><input placeholder="example@email.com" class="h-8 text-sm mt-1" value="sender@example.invalid"/></div><div><label class="text-xs">電話</label><input placeholder="+81 ..." class="h-8 text-sm mt-1" value=""/></div></div><div><label class="text-xs">住所</label><input placeholder="Street, Number" class="h-8 text-sm mt-1" value="Road"/></div><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3"><div><label class="text-xs">都市</label><input placeholder="Tokyo" class="h-8 text-sm mt-1" value="Tokyo"/></div><div><label class="text-xs">国</label><input placeholder="Japan" class="h-8 text-sm mt-1" value="JP"/></div></div><div><label class="text-xs">追加情報 <span class="text-muted-foreground font-normal">(税関番号・登録番号など)</span></label><textarea placeholder="例: 税関登録番号: EORI-12345
消費税登録番号: JP-67890" class="w-full mt-1 text-sm border border-border rounded-md px-3 py-2 bg-background resize-y min-h-[72px]"></textarea><p class="text-[10px] text-muted-foreground mt-1">請求書の差出人欄（JAPANの下）に表示されます</p></div></div><footer><button variant="outline">キャンセル</button><button>保存する</button></footer></article></section>"
